and applies configuration changes, \code{\link[=validate_config]{validate_config()}} and
\code{\link[=validate_spec]{validate_spec()}} check customization input and specifications, and
\code{\link[=check_analysis_data]{check_analysis_data()}} checks explicitly supplied data.
\item Synthetic study workflow: \code{\link[=study_spec]{study_spec()}} and \code{\link[=study_paired_spec]{study_paired_spec()}}
declare a study, \code{\link[=study_project]{study_project()}} compiles it, \code{\link[=study_run]{study_run()}} analyses
